---
// Every /ar/* URL no other route matches. Rest parameters have the LOWEST route priority,
// so this never shadows a real page (/ar, /ar/about, /ar/portfolio/[slug]…): it only
// replaces Astro's single root 404 — English, LTR, with a language switch that linked to
// itself — with the Arabic one. ar/404.astro sets the 404 status and noindex.
return Astro.rewrite('/ar/404');
---
